      }), ": Define and enforce patterns for how your application updates shared state. Use promise chaining or async queue patterns to serialize updates when order matters. Prefer immutable state updates over in-place modifications to reduce race condition risks. Implement state management libraries (Redux, MobX, Zustand) that provide structured approaches to state updates rather than ad-hoc mutations."]
